.TH tuod n 0.23.0 tclutils "Tcl Library Procedures"
.SH NAME
tuod \- tuod provides small od\-like binary dump helpers in pure Tcl.
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
.nf
::tclutils::tuod::bytes data ?options?
::tclutils::tuod::data data ?options?
::tclutils::tuod::file filename ?options?
.fi
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
.nf
\-format   octal|hex|decimal|char   default: octal
\-width    number                    default: 16
\-offset   number                    default: 0
\-length   number                    default: \-1
\-address  hex|octal|decimal|none    default: hex
.fi
.PP
\fBbytes\fR returns unsigned byte values. This avoids Tcl's signed\-byte pitfall when using \fBbinary scan\fR with \fBc\fR.

